EXPERIMENT 44 – ACCEPTANCE TESTING FOR HOTEL RESERVATION SYSTEM
AIM
To execute acceptance testing for a hotel reservation system. Acceptance testing is done with the customer or user to decide whether the system satisfies the acceptance criteria and can be accepted.
ALGORITHM
1. Collect customer requirements and write acceptance criteria for every requirement.
2. Prepare acceptance test cases. Alpha testing is performed by users at the developer's site, and beta testing by real users in their own environment.
3. Execute acceptance test cases with users in the user acceptance environment.
4. Record Accept or Reject for every criterion along with user comments.
5. Agree on acceptance criteria and the pass rule with the customer before execution.
6. Allow users to execute tests using their own data while recording their comments.
7. Decide whether to accept the system and collect customer sign-off.
INPUT
Pre-requisites and Test Environment
Item	Details
System under test	Hotel reservation system
Users	Hotel manager, receptionist and two guests
Environment	User acceptance environment (copy of production setup)
Basis	Acceptance criteria agreed with customer

Acceptance Test Cases
ID	Requirement	Acceptance Test	Expected Result	Status
AC01	Search rooms	Search by check-in date, check-out date and guests	Available rooms and rates displayed	Accept
AC02	Book a room	Select room and enter guest details	Booking confirmed with booking number	Accept
AC03	Online payment	Pay advance using card	Payment receipt displayed	Accept
AC04	Booking confirmation	Complete a booking	Confirmation email received within 5 minutes	Accept
AC05	Modify booking	Change check-out date	New date and amount displayed	Accept
AC06	Cancel booking	Cancel before cancellation limit	Booking cancelled and refund shown	Accept
AC07	Reception view	Open today's arrivals list	Guest list displayed	Accept
AC08	Generate bill	Check out a guest	Bill with room charge and tax printed	Accept
AC09	Guest feedback	Submit feedback after check-out	Feedback saved	Accept
AC10	Role-based access	Receptionist opens admin report	Access denied	Accept

OUTPUT
Alpha, Beta and User Acceptance Testing
Type	Performed By	Place	Purpose
Alpha test	Internal users or testers	Developer's site	Find defects before release
Beta test	Selected real users	User's own site	Confirm fitness for use
UAT	Customer representatives	Acceptance environment	Decide system acceptance

User Acceptance Sign-off
Item	Details
Decision	Accepted
Acceptance criteria	All 10 accepted
User comments	All acceptance criteria are satisfied
Suggestion	Show refund amount on cancellation page
Accepted by	Hotel manager
Date	15 Nov 2026

RESULT
Thus, acceptance testing of the hotel reservation system was executed against the customer's acceptance criteria, and the system was accepted.
